### Variables (REST Client / VS Code)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Crear paciente
POST {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Lucía",
  "apellido": "Martínez",
  "dni": "35987654",
  "telefono": "2615551234",
  "fecha_nacimiento": "1990-04-12",
  "obra_social": "OSDE 210"
}

### Listar pacientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/

### Obtener paciente con sus turnos
GET {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/1

### Actualizar paciente (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefono": "2615559999"
}

### Desactivar paciente (baja lógica)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pacientes/1/desactivar

### Crear turno
POST {{baseUrl}}/turnos/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paciente_id": 1,
  "fecha": "2026-09-15",
  "hora": "10:30:00",
  "profesional": "Dr. Alan Funes",
  "motivo": "Control anual"
}

### Listar turnos (con filtros opcionales)
GET {{baseUrl}}/turnos/?estado=pendiente

### Obtener un turno
GET {{baseUrl}}/turnos/1

### Reprogramar turno (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/turnos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fecha": "2026-09-18",
  "hora": "11:00:00"
}

### Confirmar turno
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/turnos/1/confirmar

### Cancelar turno
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/turnos/1/cancelar
